  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peace Support Facility for Yemen III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Peace Support Facility (PSF) in Yemen. The PSF aims to build public support for the peace process by achieving concrete and rapid improvement in people&#x2019;s lives in areas identified by the UN Special Envoy. The intent is to demonstrate alternatives to conflict, create local demand for peace, build confidence, and motivate parties to fully engage in the Special Envoy&apos;s peace process.</narrative>
  </description>
